# 👥 Employee Attrition Analysis Dashboard | Excel

## 📌 Project Overview

This is my personal Employee Attrition Analysis Dashboard project, created and designed entirely by me using Microsoft Excel.

The dashboard focuses on exploring employee attrition data and understanding workforce patterns through data analysis, visualizations, and interactive reporting.

It helps present HR-related information in a clear and structured way, making employee data easier to explore and interpret.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyze employee attrition patterns.
- Explore workforce data.
- Understand employee-related trends.
- Present HR metrics through visualizations.
- Create an interactive HR analytics dashboard.
- Transform raw data into meaningful insights.

